msgstr "用于在带有归属的回忆上下文中记录最新回忆数量。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/recallLatest|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "latest recall count"
msgstr "最新回忆数量"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/recallLatest|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The positive count of newest records requested within scope, not an age window or a claim that this many records exist."
msgstr "在范围内请求的最新记录正整数数量，而非年龄窗口，也不声称存在这么多记录。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/recallLatest|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "The record names gmeow:recallLatest explicitly."
msgstr "记录显式命名 gmeow:recallLatest。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/recallOutcomeDeadline|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring successful execution, access permission or a preferred claim from recallOutcomeDeadline alone."
msgstr "避免仅从 recallOutcomeDeadline 推断执行成功、访问权限或优先主张。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/recallOutcomeDeadline|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain the explicit recallOutcomeDeadline value with its source, scope and record identity."
msgstr "连同来源、作用域和记录身份保留显式 recallOutcomeDeadline 值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/recallOutcomeDeadline|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to record recall deadline reached within an attributed recall context."
