msgid "The record names gmeow:recallOutcomeRecollections explicitly."
msgstr "记录显式命名 gmeow:recallOutcomeRecollections。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/recallOutcome|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring successful execution, access permission or a preferred claim from recallOutcome alone."
msgstr "避免仅从 recallOutcome 推断执行成功、访问权限或优先主张。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/recallOutcome|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain the explicit recallOutcome value with its source, scope and record identity."
msgstr "连同来源、作用域和记录身份保留显式 recallOutcome 值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/recallOutcome|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
