msgid "The record names gmeow:recallOutcome explicitly."
msgstr "记录显式命名 gmeow:recallOutcome。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/recallRank|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring successful execution, access permission or a preferred claim from recallRank alone."
msgstr "避免仅从 recallRank 推断执行成功、访问权限或优先主张。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/recallRank|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
