msgstr "避免仅从 recallSchema 推断执行成功、访问权限或优先主张。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/recallSchema|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain the explicit recallSchema value with its source, scope and record identity."
msgstr "连同来源、作用域和记录身份保留显式 recallSchema 值。"

