msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/recallScope|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Link the actual schema to its selected RecallScope. Preserve the required scope and other operation parameters; retain real anchors for SlotBoundRecallScope and actual context inputs for shared selectors without fallback or invented bindings."
msgstr "将实际模式关联到所选 RecallScope。保留必需范围和其他操作参数；为 SlotBoundRecallScope 保留实际锚点，为共享选择器保留实际语境输入，不降级回退，也不编造绑定。"

